{"v": 1, "key": "cu-cu14", "cards": [{"id": "u5.t.symbiosis", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">sym<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">bi<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">O<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">sis<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"symbiosis\" data-audio=\"audio/symbiosis.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: symbiosis\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"symbiosis\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"55\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"30\" ry=\"20\" class=\"f3\"/><ellipse cx=\"145\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"30\" ry=\"20\" class=\"f2\"/><line x1=\"88.0\" y1=\"52.0\" x2=\"112.0\" y2=\"52.0\"/><polygon points=\"112.0,52.0 107.5,54.2 107.5,49.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><line x1=\"112.0\" y1=\"68.0\" x2=\"88.0\" y2=\"68.0\"/><polygon points=\"88.0,68.0 92.5,65.8 92.5,70.2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">living together<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A close, long-term relationship between two different species.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>共生<\/b>：两个不同物种之间紧密而长期的关系。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">sym = together, bio = life.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">sym = 一起，bio = 生活。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Is symbiosis always helpful to both partners?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">No. It can help both, one, or harm one.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u5.t.mycorrhiza", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">my<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">cor<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">RHI<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">za<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"mycorrhiza\" data-audio=\"audio/mycorrhiza.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: mycorrhiza\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"mycorrhiza\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"51\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Fungus gives<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">water and minerals<\/text><rect x=\"104\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"149\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Plant gives<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">sugar from<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">photosynthesis<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A partnership between a fungus and plant roots: the fungus gets sugar and the plant gets water and minerals.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>菌根<\/b>：真菌与植物根的合作：真菌得到糖，植物得到水和矿物质。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">myco = fungus, rhiza = root. Fungus root.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">myco = 真菌，rhiza = 根。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What does the plant give the fungus in a mycorrhiza?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Sugar.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u5.t.lichen", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">LI<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">chen<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"lichen\" data-audio=\"audio/lichen.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: lichen\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u5-lichen.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"566\" alt=\"Common orange lichen (Xanthoria) on bark: a fungus and an alga living together.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Common orange lichen (Xanthoria) on bark: a fungus and an alga living together.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">树皮上的石黄衣（地衣）：真菌和藻类一起生活。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: Holger Krisp · <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY 3.0<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Xanthoria-parietina-gelbflechte.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"lichen\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"51\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Fungus<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">gives shelter and<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">water<\/text><rect x=\"104\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"149\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Alga<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">makes food by<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">photosynthesis<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A partnership between a fungus and an alga or cyanobacterium living as one body.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>地衣<\/b>：真菌与藻类或蓝细菌结合成一体的共生体。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">lichen is two organisms acting as one.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">地衣是两种生物合成一体。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Which two partners make a lichen?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">A fungus and an alga (or cyanobacterium).<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u5.t.pioneer-species", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">pi<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">o<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">NEER<\/span> <span class=\"st\">SPE<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">cies<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"pioneer species\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: pioneer species\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u5-pioneer-species.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" alt=\"Lichens growing on bare rock, one of the first living things to colonise new ground.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Lichens growing on bare rock, one of the first living things to colonise new ground.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">长在裸露岩石上的地衣，是最先在新地面上定居的生物之一。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: brewbooks from near Seattle, USA · <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY-SA 2.0<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flickr_-_brewbooks_-_Lichen_Rock_at_Shipwreck_Cove,_NZ_(2).jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"pioneer species\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Bare<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">rock<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"46.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Lichens<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">grow and<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">make<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"80.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">soil<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"46.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Mosses<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">and<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">plants<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"80.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">follow<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">One of the first species to live in bare, new ground, such as lichens on rock.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>先锋物种<\/b>：最先在裸地定居的物种，如岩石上的地衣。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">pioneer = first to go in.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">pioneer = 开拓者。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Why are lichens pioneer species?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">They can grow on bare rock and help make soil.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u5.t.penicillin", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">pen<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">i<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">CIL<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">lin<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"penicillin\" data-audio=\"audio/penicillin.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: penicillin\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u5-penicillin.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"757\" alt=\"Blue-green Penicillium mold on a citrus fruit. Penicillin was first found in a Penicillium mold.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Blue-green Penicillium mold on a citrus fruit. Penicillin was first found in a Penicillium mold.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">柑橘上的蓝绿色青霉。青霉素最早就是从青霉菌中发现的。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: gailhampshire · <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY 2.0<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Penicillium_digitatum,_Penicillium_italicum_(Green_Mold,_Blue_Mold)_on_Squash_(51822354805).jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"penicillin\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"60\" r=\"22\" class=\"f3 k\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"60\" r=\"5\" class=\"f6\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Penicillium mold<\/text><line x1=\"90.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"130.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"130.0,60.0 125.5,62.2 125.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"130\" y=\"45\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f4\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">kills bacteria<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The first widely used antibiotic, made from a Penicillium mold.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>青霉素<\/b>：第一种广泛使用的抗生素，由青霉菌产生。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Penicillium = &quot;little brush&quot;. Fleming noticed it in 1928.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">1928 年弗莱明注意到青霉。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Is penicillin made by a fungus?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Yes, by Penicillium mold.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u5.t.fermentation", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">fer<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">men<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">TA<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tion<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"fermentation\" data-audio=\"audio/fermentation.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: fermentation\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"fermentation\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Sugar<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Yeast<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">without<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">oxygen<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">CO2 +<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">ethanol<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Getting energy from sugar without oxygen. Yeast makes carbon dioxide and ethanol this way.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>发酵<\/b>：在没有氧气的条件下从糖中获取能量；酵母由此产生二氧化碳和乙醇。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">fermentum = leaven. The CO2 makes bread rise.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">二氧化碳让面包发起来。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What gas makes bread dough rise?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Carbon dioxide from yeast fermentation.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}], "quiz": [{"id": "cu.q.u5.t.symbiosis", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A close, long-term relationship between two different species.”<\/i>", "opts": ["symbiosis", "basidium", "extracellular digestion", "septum"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>symbiosis<\/b>: A close, long-term relationship between two different species. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">共生<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u5.t.mycorrhiza", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A partnership between a fungus and plant roots: the fungus gets sugar and the plant gets water and minerals.”<\/i>", "opts": ["mushroom", "conidia", "mycorrhiza", "club fungi"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>mycorrhiza<\/b>: A partnership between a fungus and plant roots: the fungus gets sugar and the plant gets water and minerals. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">菌根<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u5.t.lichen", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A partnership between a fungus and an alga or cyanobacterium living as one body.”<\/i>", "opts": ["lichen", "septum", "yeast", "penicillin"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>lichen<\/b>: A partnership between a fungus and an alga or cyanobacterium living as one body. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">地衣<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u5.t.pioneer-species", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“One of the first species to live in bare, new ground, such as lichens on rock.”<\/i>", "opts": ["pioneer species", "yeast", "mycosis", "hypha"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>pioneer species<\/b>: One of the first species to live in bare, new ground, such as lichens on rock. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">先锋物种<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u5.t.penicillin", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The first widely used antibiotic, made from a Penicillium mold.”<\/i>", "opts": ["penicillin", "hypha", "mycorrhiza", "yeast"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>penicillin<\/b>: The first widely used antibiotic, made from a Penicillium mold. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">青霉素<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u5.t.fermentation", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Getting energy from sugar without oxygen. Yeast makes carbon dioxide and ethanol this way.”<\/i>", "opts": ["fermentation", "basidium", "mycelium", "mushroom"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>fermentation<\/b>: Getting energy from sugar without oxygen. Yeast makes carbon dioxide and ethanol this way. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">发酵<\/span>", "whys": null}]}